<section class="uo-tabs-section">
  <div class="uo-wrap">
    <!-- Tab Nav -->
    <div class="uo-tabs-nav">
      <button type="button" class="uo-tab-btn is-active" data-tab-target="tab-how-it-works">
        How It Works
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="uo-tab-btn" data-tab-target="tab-how-to-use">
        How To Use
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="uo-tab-btn" data-tab-target="tab-care-washing">
        Care & Washing
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="uo-tab-btn" data-tab-target="tab-fit-sizing">
        Fit & Sizing
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 1: How It Works -->
    <div class="uo-tab-panel is-active" id="tab-how-it-works">
      The FULL-SPINE ULTRA OVERNIGHT™ uses a 5-layer design and extended back coverage to absorb your flow, lock in moisture, and help prevent leaks throughout the night. The result is secure, comfortable protection made for heavy-flow nights.
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 2: How To Use -->
    <div class="uo-tab-panel" id="tab-how-to-use">
      Wear FULL-SPINE ULTRA OVERNIGHT™ just like regular underwear before going to bed. Choose your protection based on your personal flow needs and your healthcare professional's guidance. Fit should be comfortable without digging into the skin.
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 3: Care & Washing -->
    <div class="uo-tab-panel" id="tab-care-washing">
      1. Rinse in cold tap water immediately after waking until water runs clear.<br>
      2. Machine wash cold on gentle cycle with standard mild detergent (no fabric softeners or bleach).<br>
      3. Hang dry in shade or lay flat. Tumble dry on low if necessary. Engineered for repeated wash cycles when cared for as directed.
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 4: Fit & Sizing -->
    <div class="uo-tab-panel" id="tab-fit-sizing">
      Please refer to the final manufacturer-approved size chart once available. Fit may vary with body shape and preferred coverage.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

